 *   📋 Translating demo snippets
 *   🔄 ar: translating...
 *     alert: 9 string(s)
 *       ✓ 4 cached, 5 translated
 *     avatar: 32 string(s)
 *       ✓ all cached
 *   ✓ ar: rendered 65 demo file(s)
 *   ✨ All demo translations complete!
